  "c-ff-help": [
    {
      "id": "m24",
      "authorId": "u-ravi",
      "content": "Why does this log `undefined`?\n```\nfunction double(n) {\n  n * 2;\n}\nconsole.log(double(4));\n```",
      "timestamp": "2026-10-13T15:20:00Z",
      "reactions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "m25",
      "authorId": "u-priya",
      "content": "The function never *returns* anything. Add `return n * 2;`. In JavaScript a function without `return` gives back `undefined`.",
      "timestamp": "2026-10-13T15:24:00Z",
      "reactions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "m26",
      "authorId": "u-ravi",
      "content": "aaah. Python spoiled me with lambdas 😅 @Sam you had this exact bug last week, right?",
      "timestamp": "2026-10-13T15:25:00Z",
      "reactions": []
    }
  ],
